ss South Africa. Through Global Certify, his mission is to equip the next generation with the technical skills, international networks and mindset required to lead in the digital age."}]]}]]}]}],["$","div","seipone-mohale",{"className":"card p-8 group hover:border-gold-200 transition-colors","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-green-100 text-green-700 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0","children":["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-users w-7 h-7","children":[["$","path","1yyitq",{"d":"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"}],["$","circle","nufk8",{"cx":"9","cy":"7","r":"4"}],["$","path","kshegd",{"d":"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"}],["$","path","1da9ce",{"d":"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-navy-900","children":"Seipone Mohale"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-medium text-gold-600 mb-3","children":"Chief Operating Officer (COO)"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-navy-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Mechatronics and Robotics Engineering (Russia), with experience in engineering project management. Focus on strategic operations, organisational development, process optimisation and cross-functional coordination. Bridging technical expertise with strategic leadership to drive operational excellence and sustainable organisational growth."}]]}]]}]}],["$","div","mxolisi-nomdletshe",{"className":"card p-8 group hover:border-gold-200 transition-colors","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center flex-s